sk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135719118,imgsize-657210.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US treasury secy Scott Bessent moves to military base after alleged Iranian threats]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135724620.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-treasury-secretary-scott-bessent-moves-to-military-base-after-alleged-iranian-threats/articleshow/135724620.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-treasury-secretary-scott-bessent-moves-to-military-base-after-alleged-iranian-threats/articleshow/135724620.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T10:01:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135725736,imgsize-883989.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US commerce secy was sent secret memo on Nvidia CEO’s affair with Chinese spy: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135724372.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US commerce secretary Howard Lutnick had recieved a confidential memo revealing Nvidia's CEO, Jensen Huang's  ties to a woman suspected of being a Chinese spy. The memo was circulated ahead of President Trump's visit to China in May. Although US officials alerted Trump about Huang’s connections, no action was taken, and Huang was invited on the trip. This situation has raised alarms over Huang's role in shaping AI policies and decisions affecting Nvidia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-commerce-secretary-was-sent-secret-memo-on-nvidia-ceos-affair-with-chinese-spy-report/articleshow/135724372.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-commerce-secretary-was-sent-secret-memo-on-nvidia-ceos-affair-with-chinese-spy-report/articleshow/135724372.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T08:56:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135724560,imgsize-80102.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Coded calls from Brooklyn jail: How Iran operative directed terror plots in Europe, US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135723031.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A US indictment alleges that an Iran-backed operative jailed in New York used coded calls with family members to coordinate a plot against RAF Fairford, a British air base housing US troops. The accused and two associates are also alleged to have planned nearly 20 attacks targeting Jewish communities across Europe and the US.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/coded-calls-from-brooklyn-jail-how-iran-backed-operative-coordinated-terror-plots-in-europe-us/articleshow/135723031.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/coded-calls-from-brooklyn-jail-how-iran-backed-operative-coordinated-terror-plots-in-europe-us/articleshow/135723031.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T08:04:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135723225,imgsize-858243.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[57 injured as bus crashes into 31 vehicles in South Korea]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135722831.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/57-injured-as-bus-crashes-into-31-vehicles-in-south-korea/articleshow/135722831.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/57-injured-as-bus-crashes-into-31-vehicles-in-south-korea/articleshow/135722831.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T07:40:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135722841,imgsize-1519987.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Unfit to remain in office’: Eisenkot attacks Netanyahu after ‘hateful’ Knesset speech]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135722286.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Gadi Eisenkot's Yashar party cancelled a meeting with Netanyahu's Likud party after his controversial speech. Eisenkot criticized Netanyahu for his divisive and unfit behavior during the Knesset swearing-in ceremony. Netanyahu continues to advocate for a unity government while rejecting ties with Arab parties. The political landscape remains fragmented with no party holding a clear majority in the Knesset.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/unfit-to-remain-in-office-eisenkot-attacks-netanyahu-after-hateful-knesset-speech/articleshow/135722286.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/unfit-to-remain-in-office-eisenkot-attacks-netanyahu-after-hateful-knesset-speech/articleshow/135722286.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T07:10:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135722517,imgsize-90488.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US army officer arrested in UK on suspicion of spying for Russia]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135722399.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A US army officer serving with Nato's Allied Rapid Reaction Corps was arrested near Gloucester in England on suspicion of espionage linked to Russia, British police said. The 41-year-old suspect faces allegations of assisting a foreign intelligence service and obtaining or disclosing protected information. The arrest comes amid growing European concerns over Russian covert operations, sabotage and espionage targeting Nato countries.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/us-army-officer-arrested-in-uk-on-suspicion-of-spying-for-russia/articleshow/135722399.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/us-army-officer-arrested-in-uk-on-suspicion-of-spying-for-russia/articleshow/135722399.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T07:02:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135722424,imgsize-161150.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nvidia hires top US law firm to investigate affair between CEO Huang and Chinese spy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135722351.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nvidia has engaged the law firm Wachtell, Lipton, Rosen &amp; Katz to probe allegations against CEO Jensen Huang, who is implicated in a case involving a suspected Chinese spy named Alice Huang. While Jensen has acknowledged a personal relationship with Alice, he firmly denies any involvement in espionage. The FBI has also launched a separate investigation, but Nvidia reassures all stakeholders that trade secrets and national security remain intact.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nvidia-hires-top-us-law-firm-to-investigate-